  "explanation": "<h3>Gross profit</h3><p>$500,000 − $300,000 − $25,000 = $175,000.</p><h3>Gross-profit percentage</h3><p>$175,000 ÷ $500,000 = 35%.</p><h3>Current installment gain</h3><p>$200,000 principal × 35% = $70,000.</p><h3>Basis recovery included in current principal</h3><p>$200,000 collected less $70,000 gain = $130,000 basis recovery.</p>"
